Z||000004||fieroshop||10-29-1999||09:59 AM||||To be honest if you smell gas constantly then you mih=ght have a broken fuel line. It seems that when I get one car with that problem I get a few more at the same time. I just repaired two Fieros with a broken return line. Check out your lines and if the smell still persists then check out the injectors||||reg||9
